WEBVTT

00:12:27.993 --> 00:12:33.081
for equitable, financially sustainable
urban neighborhoods.

00:12:34.082 --> 00:12:36.877
The list goes on and on.

00:12:38.086 --> 00:12:39.213
This ...

00:12:40.923 --> 00:12:45.844
This is how we develop the strong,

00:12:45.844 --> 00:12:51.183
the strong leaders
and critical thinkers of tomorrow.

00:12:52.476 --> 00:12:55.187
Our students deserve to learn

00:12:55.229 --> 00:13:02.194
in an environment that includes
and understands their unique voice,